---
description: TownScene, its overlays and town building menus
globs:
  - src/scenes/TownScene.ts
  - src/scenes/town/**/*.ts
  - src/systems/TownBuildings.ts
  - src/systems/townBuildingMenu.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

- `TownScene` coordinates `town/TownOverlays.ts` (spell sort, save menu, debug launch), `TownHeader.ts` and `TownTouchDebug.ts`. Endless roster and wave planner use lazy scenes `TownEndlessSetup` / `TownWavePlannerSetup` (`townSetupSceneLifecycle.ts`) with Town paused.
- Building actions come from `town_buildings.json` flags (`startsNight`, `upgradeId`, `opensSpellBar`, `opensEndlessMode`, `opensWavePlanner`), routed by `townBuildingMenu.ts`.
- Defense runs start through `beginDefenseRun` with a run mode (campaign, endless or wave planner). The town applies `NightResult` once, on return.
- E2E tap targets: `town/TownSceneE2E.ts` (`town-building-<id>`) plus each panel's `e2eTapTargets()`.
